Assumption challenge
--------------------
Vertices considered: LRC runners, LRC residues, gcd strata, carry
cocycles, Moser points, Moser directions, slabs, ears, exact cores,
and proof routes.  The script uses proof routes because the preserved
predicate is which transfer can explain both difficulties without
forgetting the side channel.
